Module(
  body=[
    Expr(
      value=Constant(value='\nHop 7: Document Rendering - HIGH-SIGNAL OVERWRITE\n\nThis is a spec-driven, context-aware renderer.\n1. It loads a "render_spec" (mocked inline) to define document\n   structure, order, and content sourcing.\n2. It dynamically sources content from the HOP-4 staging buffer\n   (for LLM content) AND the HOP-0 thematic analysis (for\n   guaranteed-alignment data like keywords).\n3. It generates a "High-Signal App Tracker" entry, which serves\n   as a performance snapshot of the run, including RAG signal\n   quality and final alignment scores from HOP-5.\n')),
